# asciiart — big text banners in the terminal

## figlet — plain ASCII art text

```sh
figlet Cheat
#  ____ _                _
# / ___| |__   ___  __ _| |_
#| |   | '_ \ / _ \/ _` | __|
#| |___| | | |  __/ (_| | |_
# \____|_| |_|\___|\__,_|\__|
```

## toilet — color and borders

```sh
# Show with a border
toilet -F border Cheat

# Basic show (filled)
toilet Cheat

# Rainbow filter
toilet -F gay Cheat
```

## Real-world: MOTD banner for the homelab box

```sh
sudo zypper install -y figlet
figlet -f slant homelab | sudo tee /etc/motd
```

## Real-world: session opener in ~/.zshrc

```sh
# Greet with hostname art on new shells
command -v figlet >/dev/null && figlet -f small $(hostname)
```

| Tool   | Strength                          |
| ------ | --------------------------------- |
| figlet | fonts galore (`showfigfonts`)     |
| toilet | color filters, borders, unicode   |
